OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy morning, with a
OL,6,Flittle rain and perhaps the odd
OL,7,Fheavier showery burst. Becoming drier
OL,8,Fand brighter in the afternoon, with
OL,9,Fsome warm sunny spells. Breezy at
OL,10,Ffirst, easing as the day progresses.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FAfter a fine end to the day,
OL,13,Fit will stay dry with variable amounts
OL,14,Fof cloud and clear spells. A cooler
OL,15,Fnight for many, especially in rural
OL,16,Fareas. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
