OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FA cool start, otherwise, it
OL,6,Fwill be a fine day, with variable
OL,7,Famounts of cloud and bright or sunny
OL,8,Fspells for many. Temperatures will be
OL,9,Fclose to normal. Light winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,12,Fwill be fine with variable cloud and
OL,13,Fbright or sunny spells. Feeling warmer
OL,14,Fwith light winds. Dry with warm sunny
OL,15,Fspells Tuesday. Cloudier on Wednesday.
OL,16,FSome cool nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
